Third party code

third_party/whisper.cpp (a git submodule) is whisper.cpp by Georgi Gerganov
and contributors, MIT license (third_party/whisper.cpp/LICENSE).

third_party/media_kit_video is a patched copy of media_kit_video by Hitesh
Kumar Saini, MIT license (third_party/media_kit_video/LICENSE); the changes
are described in third_party/media_kit_video/ARCA.md.

The speech models downloaded by the app are unchanged copies of the
quantized whisper.cpp models (ggerganov/whisper.cpp on Hugging Face), MIT
license.
